  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To A Charmed Life<br>King / 1 Queen / 2 Twins / Twin Over Full Bunk w/ Twin Trundle<br><br>“I must say I often feel I lead one!” said Pinkie Flamingo as she landed gracefully atop her newest guest nest. And you must lead one as too, as your search for the perfect vacation spot has lead you here. A Charmed Life is the latest in an all-star line-up of fine vacation rentals. As a curator of the best guest nests on Florida's Gulf Coast, it was Pinkie's duty to personally inspect each one. For those who truly lead a charmed life, good luck is an everyday event. For everyone else…it's high time you discovered “A Charmed Life” too.<br><br>Tucked away amongst the sand dunes just off the winding coastal thoroughfare known as “30A”, the popular beach community of Serenity at Dune Allen stands waiting to be the backdrop on which to paint your next vacation memories. Composed of a diverse array of charming beach communities and quaint eclectic neighborhoods, the beaches along Florida Scenic Hwy 30A in South Walton County in Northwest Florida have a collective appeal to just about everyone. Each of the sixteen neighborhoods has its own unique style and affords a different vacation experience. Today Pinkie was in Dune Allen, where recreational opportunities abound as Mother Nature serves up a trifecta of rare inland coastal lakes…Oyster, Stallworth and Allen Lakes. Activities like canoeing, paddle boarding and yes…bird watching are all quite the rage.<br><br>What Pinkie LOVES About A Charmed Life<br>•\tHot Tub<br>•. Charming Coastal Décor<br>•\tLots of Natural Light<br>•\tFully-Equipped Kitchen<br>•\tWIFI <br>•\tBBQ Grill<br>•\tCommunity Pool<br>•\tBeach Gear Including Chairs, Umbrella and Cart<br><br>Getting to the beach is easy with several public accesses nearby. Popular with locals and tourists alike, Dune Allen is within walking or biking distance to the restaurants and nightlife of Gulf Place, as well as, other local eateries like Stinky's Fish Camp. Take a short walk or drive for an easy breakfast and coffee to The Perfect Pig or Sunrise Coffee, which also serves Charlie's Donuts made fresh every day. Shunk Gulley Oyster Bar at Gulf Place is just down 30A and features daily live music...simply an incredible place to watch the sunset, some great tuna poke and cocktails. And no beach trip is complete without ice cream. Pecan Jacks at Gulf Place and Blue Mountain Beach Creamery are great spots for this indulgence. Longleaf Greenway Trailhead is a Florida state forest trail for the enjoyment of bicyclists, hikers, runners and nature lovers and is just a few minutes down the road. Head a few minutes further east on 30A to Grayton Beach and access many fabulous local eateries like Black Bear Bread Co. and Stumptown coffee. Sunday brunch at the Red Bar or a beer on the deck at Chiringos are other favorites in the area. It is also worth visiting the Grayton Beer Company where you can fill up with something delicious like the Beach Permit Blonde Ale or the Fish Whistle IPA to enjoy back on the deck as the sun goes down. <br><br>This Emerald Coast vacation rental find will be one you will want to return to ...year after year.<br><br>Makin' My Way Along 30A...Dune Allen<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>•\tMust Be 25 To Book<br>•\tNo Smoking <br>•\tCancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>•\tSheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>•\tAll Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>•\tBasic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "🦩Book Me Baby! A Charmed Life at Miramar Beach🦩"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
